{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 517483, "name": "Luca Albrecht", "username": "g3ntleli0n", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-07-16T14:42:45.702Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>I’m not quite certain if this is the correct place to ask, but I am a bit confused to be honest. I have been trying to figure out how I (as a non packager) can become a packager for the Fedora repository. There is a certain orphaned package <a href=\"https://packages.fedoraproject.org/pkgs/python-magnumclient/\">python-magnumclient</a> I would like to adopt and maintain as It is still used and there are newer upstream version of the software available, but im in a bit of a documentation loop. There are multiple documentations that have guided me into different directions but I can’t figure out where I need to create a post/issue and what information it must contain.</p>\n<p>So my main question is: Where do I apply to become a “packager”? I saw some mention of a sponsorship, how do I request a sponsor?</p>\n<p>Can someone lead me into the right direction?<br>\nThanks <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/slight_smile.png?v=15\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-16T14:42:45.702Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 44, "readers_count": 43, "score": 48.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 196865, "topic_slug": "contribute-to-fedora-repository", "display_username": "Luca Albrecht", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://packages.fedoraproject.org/pkgs/python-magnumclient/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "python-magnumclient - Fedora Packages", "clicks": 4}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 28032, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/contribute-to-fedora-repository/196865/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 517500, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2026-07-16T15:15:25.891Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi there, it’s great that you are looking to participate in project maintenance.</p>\n<p>This is usually the starting point for new package maintainers:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Joining_the_Package_Maintainers/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Joining_the_Package_Maintainers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fedora Docs</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:225/62;\"><img src=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/_/img/docs_logo.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"62\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Joining_the_Package_Maintainers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Joining the Package Maintainers</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Learn more about Fedora Linux, the Fedora Project &amp; the Fedora Community.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>For the package you’re looking at, since it’s been orphaned for a while, it’ll require a re-review:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Package_Orphaning_Process/#claiming_ownership_of_an_orphaned_package\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Package_Orphaning_Process/#claiming_ownership_of_an_orphaned_package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fedora Docs</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:225/62;\"><img src=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/_/img/docs_logo.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"62\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Package_Orphaning_Process/#claiming_ownership_of_an_orphaned_package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claiming Ownership of an Orphaned Package - Package Orphaning Process</a></h3>\n\n  <p>This page contains instructions for working with orphan packages as specified in Policy for Orphan and Retired Packages. | Learn more about Fedora Linux, the Fedora Project &amp; the Fedora Community.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>So, when you post the re-review, you can mention that you need a sponsor (follow the new package process in the above docs). That way, a sponsor will help with the review and add you to the package maintainers group once the review is complete.</p>\n<p>Does that make sense?</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-16T15:15:25.891Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 43, "readers_count": 42, "score": 73.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 196865, "topic_slug": "contribute-to-fedora-repository", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Package_Orphaning_Process/#claiming_ownership_of_an_orphaned_package", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 2}, {"url": "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/Joining_the_Package_Maintainers/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 1}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 4}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/contribute-to-fedora-repository/196865/2", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 3}, {"id": "bluethumb", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 4, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 517502, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2026-07-16T15:17:38.209Z", "cooked": "<p>This is also relevant:</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/#discovering\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/#discovering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fedora Docs</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:225/62;\"><img src=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/_/img/docs_logo.png\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"62\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/#discovering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discovering packages that need maintenance - How to Get Sponsored into the...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Packager sponsor policy governs sponsorship for the packager group. This page contains some additional tips that are not part of the policy. | Learn more about Fedora Linux, the Fedora Project &amp; the Fedora Community.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>So, it’s also worth e-mailing the devel list etc.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-16T15:17:38.209Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 39, "readers_count": 38, "score": 37.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 196865, "topic_slug": "contribute-to-fedora-repository", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/#discovering", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 1}], "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/contribute-to-fedora-repository/196865/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 518256, "name": "Luca Albrecht", "username": "g3ntleli0n", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-07-20T11:07:00.456Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks you for you quick and easy to understand reply. I’ have just introduced myself to the devel mailing list.</p>\n<p>I’ve seen that the documentation on the following page <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/\">docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/</a> states that I need to create an issue on the <a href=\"https://pagure.io/packager-sponsors/issues\">pagure.io/packager-sponsors/issues</a> site. But all the existing issues have a link to an external bugzilla issue. However, I cannot see any mention of bugzilla on the mentioned fedora documentation page. What is the correct process here? First, create a bugzilla issue and link it there?</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T11:07:00.456Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 26, "readers_count": 25, "score": 25.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 196865, "topic_slug": "contribute-to-fedora-repository", "display_username": "Luca Albrecht", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://pagure.io/packager-sponsors/issues", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 1}, {"url": "https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/package-maintainers/How_to_Get_Sponsored_into_the_Packager_Group/", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 78, "username": "ankursinha", "name": "FranciscoD", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 28032, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/contribute-to-fedora-repository/196865/4", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 518271, "name": "FranciscoD", "username": "ankursinha", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png", "created_at": "2026-07-20T11:58:44.432Z", "cooked": "<p>I think the way it works is that when you add the “NEEDSPONSOR” key word to your review ticket on bugzilla, it automatically creates a ticket for you in the package-sponsors issues. So, I’d try that first. if automation doesnt create an issue in the package-sponsors repo, we can create one manually.</p>\n<p>(If it does, we should update the documentation to note this)</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T11:58:44.432Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 9.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 196865, "topic_slug": "contribute-to-fedora-repository", "display_username": "FranciscoD", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "reply_to_user": {"id": 28032, "username": "g3ntleli0n", "name": "Luca Albrecht", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/603e79/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 78, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 3, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/contribute-to-fedora-repository/196865/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": null}, {"id": 518319, "name": "Luca Albrecht", "username": "g3ntleli0n", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/g/603e79/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-07-20T16:14:27.884Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks for your help <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ankursinha\">@ankursinha</a> . I managed to get it working and create a bugzilla issue as well as uploading it to copr. I still had to create the package-sponsors issue myself, but I got it, so thank you <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/slight_smile.png?v=15\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> (<a href=\"https://pagure.io/packager-sponsors/issue/781\">Requesting sponsorship for python-magnumclient</a>).</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 6, "updated_at": "2026-07-20T16:14:27.884Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 17, "readers_count": 16, "score": 18.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 196865, "topic_slug": "contribute-to-fedora-repository", "display_username": "Luca Albrecht", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://pagure.io/packager-sponsors/issue/781", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Making sure you're not a bot!", "clicks": 2}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 78, "username": "ankursinha", "name": "FranciscoD", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 28032, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [{"id": 78, "username": "ankursinha", "name": "FranciscoD", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ankursinha/{size}/71_2.png"}], "post_url": "/t/contribute-to-fedora-repository/196865/7", "event": null, "reactions"